but who knows once we get into it.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.700
It might be crap, it might be great.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.780
Oh good! The typical controls on every game ever made.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.680
"Watch your back, sometimes the shadows can stalk you..."

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.480
